WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:04.600
The motto of this year’s BMW Group
Report is “Already ahead”.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.080
It is indeed a confident statement.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:11.080
And we back it up
– as always – with facts.

00:00:11.560 --> 00:00:15.600
This bold claim applies to our stable
and profitable business model –

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.800
even and especially in a highly volatile
environment.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:23.880
It also applies to BMW’s
consistent and long-term

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:27.720
strategic orientation.
For our customers worldwide,

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.880
we bring innovation to life
in our vehicles –

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:34.520
offering them unparalleled sheer
driving pleasure.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:40.400
The new BMW iX3 is the first vehicle
of our NEUE KLASSE.

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:45.160
Demand is high
and even exceeds our expectations.

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:48.720
And the iX3 is just the beginning.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:53.720
We are now rolling out the NEUE
KLASSE technologies across the entire

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:58.240
BMW portfolio: in the 3 Series,
the 7 Series,

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:02.720
and the X5 – to name
just a few of the new models

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:03.960
launching this year.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.200
Take a look at our online report

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:10.440
to see for yourself
how well the company is performing.

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:15.840
There are also four exciting stories
from across the BMW Group to explore.

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:21.920
“Already ahead” is not only our claim,
but a reality we live by.

